<title>UK: Paribas leads mark bond for Russian Investment.</title>
<headline>Paribas leads mark bond for Russian Investment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following repackaged bond was announced by lead manager Paribas Capital Markets, Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RUSSIAN INVESTMENT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *14.0	MATURITY  **19.MAR.15</p>
<p> TYPE   REPACKAGED    ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.50     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TILL 19.MAR.01 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR STEPS-DOWN</p>
<p>		TO 10 PCT.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS ***</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  2.00</p>
<p> NOTES    **IF RUSSIAN DEBT RESTRUCTURING IS NOT COMPLETED BY</p>
<p>		31.DEC.97 THE NOTE WILL BE REDEEMED ON 15.JAN.98</p>
<p>		BEARING AN INTEREST OF 3.0 PCT.</p>
<p>	   ***US/UK/CY/DE/RU</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
